WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.050
A website is a folder: the page, and every file it uses, side by side

2
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:09.000
This page uses three pictures from beside it.

3
00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:15.378
Download saves the page as index.html, the name a website's first page has.

4
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:23.205
Then it lists every file the page uses. Each goes in the same folder.

5
00:00:24.259 --> 00:00:29.334
Open index.html from that folder. If it works there, it works online.
